  "IW08|1307|SCANRES|$T_IW7Q_PREDICATES;$T_IW7Q_DEFAULT;$T_IW7Q_UNKNOWN_BAND;$T_IW7Q_FLOOR;$T_IW7Q_UNKNOWN;$T_IW7Q_NOT_MODEL"

  # IW09 makes the two predicates each other's negation. A telemetry reader
