  "IW09|1308|SCANRES|$T_IW7Q_PREDICATES;$T_IW7Q_REFINED_UNKNOWN;$T_IW7Q_REFINED_SURFACES"

  # IW10 moves the struct's default from `.unknown` to `.model`. Every writer
